@startuml
[*] --> Ordered : Purchase Order placed
Ordered --> InTransit : Supplier dispatches
InTransit --> Received : Goods arrive at dock
Received --> Quarantined : Failed Quality Check
Quarantined --> Returned : Sent back to Supplier
Quarantined --> Available : Quality Check passed after review
Received --> Available : Passed Quality Check
Available --> Allocated : Reserved for Shipment
Allocated --> Shipped : Dispatched to Customer
Shipped --> [*]

Available --> Damaged : Damaged in Warehouse
Damaged --> WrittenOff : Discarded
WrittenOff --> [*]
Returned --> [*]
@enduml
